---
// AI Agent Demo — Birky Studio sales bot, real WhatsApp CTA
---
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Birky Studio — Live AI Demo</title>
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <style is:inline>
    * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }
    body { font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif; background: #0f172a; color: #fff; min-height: 100vh; display: flex; flex-direction: column; }
    .demo-bar { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #6366f1, #ec4899); padding: 10px 20px; text-align: center; font-size: 0.82rem; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 0.5px; }
    .demo-bar span { opacity: 0.9; }
    .content { flex: 1; display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; padding: 20px 20px 24px; gap: 18px; justify-content: space-between; }
    .phone-mockup { width: 100%; max-width: 380px; background: #1e293b; border-radius: 24px; padding: 18px; border: 1px solid #334155; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px; flex: 1; justify-content: center; }
    .chat-bubble { max-width: 88%; padding: 10px 14px; border-radius: 16px; font-size: 0.85rem; line-height: 1.55; animation: fadeIn 0.4s ease; }
    .chat-bubble.bot { background: #334155; color: #e2e8f0; border-bottom-left-radius: 4px; align-self: flex-start; }
    .chat-bubble.user { background: #6366f1; color: #fff; border-bottom-right-radius: 4px; align-self: flex-end; }
    .chat-bubble .time { display: block; font-size: 0.65rem; color: #64748b; margin-top: 4px; text-align: right; }
    .chat-bubble.user .time { color: rgba(255,255,255,0.5); }
    .typing-dots { align-self: flex-start; padding: 8px 16px; background: #334155; border-radius: 16px; border-bottom-left-radius: 4px; display: flex; gap: 4px; }
    .typing-dots span { width: 6px; height: 6px; background: #64748b; border-radius: 50%; animation: bounce 1.4s infinite; }
    .typing-dots span:nth-child(2) { animation-delay: 0.2s; }
    .typing-dots span:nth-child(3) { animation-delay: 0.4s; }
    .try-btn { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; background: #25D366; color: white; padding: 14px 32px; border-radius: 100px; font-size: 1rem; font-weight: 700; text-decoration: none; transition: all 0.2s; border: none; cursor: pointer; }
    .try-btn:hover { transform: scale(1.05); box-shadow: 0 8px 30px rgba(37,211,102,0.4); }
    .try-btn svg { width: 22px; height: 22px; flex-shrink: 0; }
    .qr-section { display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; gap: 10px; }
    .qr-section img { width: 120px; height: 120px; border-radius: 12px; border: 2px solid #334155; }
    .qr-section p { font-size: 0.75rem; color: #64748b; }
    @keyframes bounce { 0%, 60%, 100% { transform: translateY(0); } 30% { transform: translateY(-6px); } }
    @keyframes fadeIn { from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(8px); } to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); } }
    @media (min-height: 700px) { .content { gap: 28px; } }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="demo-bar">
  <span>🤖 This demo goes live on WhatsApp — try the real thing below 👇</span>
</div>

<div class="content">
  <!-- Live Conversation Preview -->
  <div class="phone-mockup">
    <div class="chat-bubble bot">
      👋 Hey! I'm Birky Studio's AI assistant. I can tell you about our websites, AI agents, and receptionist plans. What's your business type?
      <span class="time">10:02 AM</span>
    </div>
    <div class="chat-bubble user">
      I'm a real estate agent in Antigua
      <span class="time">10:02 AM</span>
    </div>
    <div class="typing-dots"><span></span><span></span><span></span></div>
    <div class="chat-bubble bot" style="animation-delay: 0.2s;">
      Great, I work with lots of agents here! 🏠 For real estate, I'd recommend our <strong>AI Agent Setup at $1,297</strong> — it comes with a Notion CRM system, property search, email automation, and WhatsApp integration. Want me to walk you through what's included?
      <span class="time">10:02 AM</span>
    </div>
    <div class="chat-bubble user">
      Yeah tell me more
      <span class="time">10:03 AM</span>
    </div>
    <div class="typing-dots"><span></span><span></span><span></span></div>
    <div class="chat-bubble bot" style="animation-delay: 0.4s;">
      Sure! Here's what you get: 🤖 A dedicated AI trained on YOUR business — it learns your listings, your pricing, your process. It handles WhatsApp messages, qualifies leads, drafts emails, and even writes listing descriptions. All bilingual EN/ES. Setup takes one 2-3 hour remote session and you can text it like you're texting me now. Want to see a sample listing description I can write?
      <span class="time">10:03 AM</span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- CTA -->
  <a href="https://wa.me/50234775110?text=Hi%20Birky%20Studio!%20I%20saw%20the%20demo%20on%20your%20website%20and%20want%20to%20try%20the%20real%20AI." target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="try-btn">
    <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="white"><path d="M17.472 14.382c-.297-.149-1.758-.867-2.03-.967-.273-.099-.471-.148-.67.15-.197.297-.767.966-.94 1.164-.173.199-.347.223-.644.075-.297-.15-1.255-.463-2.39-1.475-.883-.788-1.48-1.761-1.653-2.059-.173-.297-.018-.458.13-.606.134-.133.298-.347.446-.52.149-.174.198-.298.298-.497.099-.198.05-.371-.025-.52-.075-.149-.669-1.612-.916-2.207-.242-.579-.487-.5-.669-.51-.173-.008-.371-.01-.57-.01-.198 0-.52.074-.792.372-.272.297-1.04 1.016-1.04 2.479 0 1.462 1.065 2.875 1.213 3.074.149.198 2.096 3.2 5.077 4.487.709.306 1.262.489 1.694.625.712.227 1.36.195 1.871.118.571-.085 1.758-.719 2.006-1.413.248-.694.248-1.289.173-1.413-.074-.124-.272-.198-.57-.347m-5.421 7.403h-.004a9.87 9.87 0 01-5.031-1.378l-.361-.214-3.741.982.998-3.648-.235-.374a9.86 9.86 0 01-1.51-5.26c.001-5.45 4.436-9.884 9.888-9.884 2.64 0 5.122 1.03 6.988 2.898a9.825 9.825 0 012.893 6.994c-.003 5.45-4.437 9.884-9.885 9.884m8.413-18.297A11.815 11.815 0 0012.05 0C5.495 0 .16 5.335.157 11.892c0 2.096.547 4.142 1.588 5.945L.057 24l6.305-1.654a11.882 11.882 0 005.683 1.448h.005c6.554 0 11.89-5.335 11.893-11.893a11.821 11.821 0 00-3.48-8.413z"/></svg>
    Try the Real AI on WhatsApp
  </a>

  <div class="qr-section">
    <img src="https://api.qrserver.com/v1/create-qr-code/?size=300x300&data=https://wa.me/50234775110?text=Hi%20Birky%20Studio!%20I%20saw%20the%20demo%20on%20your%20website" alt="QR Code to try BirkyStudio on WhatsApp" loading="lazy">
    <p>Scan to try it now ✨</p>
  </div>
</div>

</body>
</html>